  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the yakimono grill to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together olive oil, garlic, ginger, red wine, paprika, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the lemongrass stalks to the bowl and marinate for at least 30 minutes.",
    "Thread a lemongrass stalk, a cherry tomato half, and a lemongrass stalk onto each skewer.",
    "Brush the grill with olive oil to prevent sticking.",
    "Grill the skewers for 10 minutes, turning occasionally.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy.",
    "Garnish with fresh parsley or cilantro if desired.",
    "Let the skewers rest for 5 minutes before serving."
